Comment: 0,0:00:50.49,0:00:55.25,translation A,A,0,0,0,karaoke,{\k1}To be gothic and lolita, there’s no greater beauty than that in the world
Comment: 0,0:00:55.25,0:01:00.31,translation *,*,0,0,0,karaoke,{\k1}Ruling with blind omnipotence, we take over all, in the name of feminism!
Comment: 0,0:01:00.31,0:01:04.72,translation *,*,0,0,0,karaoke,{\k1}I’ll ensure none stand in its way—
Comment: 0,0:01:04.86,0:01:07.44,translation B,B,0,0,0,karaoke,{\k1}Struggle as I may
Comment: 0,0:01:07.53,0:01:13.20,translation B,B,0,0,0,karaoke,{\k1}O... Lucifer’s Attestation...
Comment: 0,0:01:15.92,0:01:20.82,translation A,A,0,0,0,karaoke,{\k1}A jet-black gothic screams out in pain and unfettered anguish
Comment: 0,0:01:20.82,0:01:26.02,translation *,*,0,0,0,karaoke,{\k1}A gentle nip by a lolita—a bit of ecstasy from her {\i1}secret garden{\i0}
Comment: 0,0:01:26.02,0:01:28.42,translation **,**,0,0,0,karaoke,{\k1}I feel lonely these days
Comment: 0,0:01:28.42,0:01:31.10,translation *,*,0,0,0,karaoke,{\k1}In the midst of a world made chaotic
Comment: 0,0:01:31.10,0:01:33.47,translation *,*,0,0,0,karaoke,{\k1}I don’t want to lose you
Comment: 0,0:01:33.47,0:01:35.84,translation *,*,0,0,0,karaoke,{\k1}You who’s surpassed all creation
Comment: 0,0:01:35.84,0:01:43.00,translation **,**,0,0,0,karaoke,{\k1}The sheep flock together in resistance, having all gathered here
Comment: 0,0:01:43.00,0:01:47.59,translation *,*,0,0,0,karaoke,{\k1}As the song of last judgment rings out across the land
Comment: 0,0:01:47.66,0:01:48.45,translation A,A,0,0,0,karaoke,{\k1}Awaken at my call!
Comment: 0,0:01:48.45,0:01:53.37,translation **,**,0,0,0,karaoke,{\k1}To be gothic and lolita, there’s nothing as beautiful in the whole world
Comment: 0,0:01:53.37,0:01:58.38,translation **,**,0,0,0,karaoke,{\k1}Ruling with blind omnipotence, we take over all, in the name of feminism!
Comment: 0,0:01:58.38,0:02:03.46,translation **,**,0,0,0,karaoke,{\k1}You have nowhere to run anymore, with us your consciousness will soon be joined
Comment: 0,0:02:03.46,0:02:08.68,translation *,*,0,0,0,karaoke,{\k1}Stare right into my eyes, around us the flow of time dies, and you melt into me
Comment: 0,0:02:08.68,0:02:13.55,translation *,*,0,0,0,karaoke,{\k1}The myth of love and eternal vows, reality disavows
